<article class="env-lemma" id="01Q2">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/01Q2">Lemma <span data-tag="01Q2">28.27.12</span>.</a> Let $X$ be a scheme. Let $S$ be a graded ring. Assume $X$ is quasi-compact, and assume there exists an open immersion </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  j : X \longrightarrow Y = \text{Proj}(S).  \]
</div>
  <p> Then $j^*\mathcal{O}_ Y(d)$ is an invertible ample sheaf for some $d > 0$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This is Constructions, Lemma <a href="/tag/01MW" data-tag="01MW">27.10.6</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>